OL,3,GNEWSADoctor did not believe triple
OL,4,Akiller was delusional
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor who examined a man less than
OL,7,F24 hours before he went on to kill
OL,8,Fthree elderly men during a psychotic
OL,9,Fepisode concluded, after a 15-minute
OL,10,Fassessment, that he was not delusional,
OL,11,Fan inquest has heard.
OL,13,FAlexander Lewis-Ranwell, now 35, was
OL,14,Farrested and released twice in the days
OL,15,Fbefore he killed Anthony Payne, 80, and
OL,16,Ftwins Roger and Dick Carter, 84 in
OL,17,FExeter on 10 February 2019.
