OL,6,FAn inquest into their deaths heard
OL,7,Fpolice officers, health workers and
OL,8,FLewis-Ranwell's mother all rasied
OL,9,Fconcerns about his mental health during
OL,10,Fhis two periods in custody from 8
OL,11,FFebruary.
OL,13,FDr Mihail Pichiu denied he failed to
OL,14,Fact on "warning signs" Lewis-Ranwell
OL,15,Fwas seriously unwell.
